<hgroup><h1>Global trends, local harms: availability of fentanyl-type drugs on the dark web and accidental overdoses in Ohio</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Lokala%20U"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Usha Lokala</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
