<div class="d-panels font-secondary-light">
<div id="aip_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none">
<div class="p" id="A1">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Kno.e.sis Center, Wright State University, Dayton, OH, USA</div>
<div id="A2">
<sup>2</sup>Department of Society and Health, Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Mahidol University, Nakhon Pathom, Thailand</div>
<div id="A3">
