<div class="p text-right font-secondary"><a href="table/T1/" class="usa-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open in a new tab</a></div>
<div class="tw-foot p">
<div class="fn" id="TFN1">
<sup>a</sup><p class="display-inline" id="P34">Includes mentions of Fentanyl, China White Heroin, Synthetic Heroin, and mentions of pharmaceutical fentanyl, such as Duragesic, fentanyl patches, fentanyl transdermal system</p>
</div>
